## 5. Alternative module_param trigger
Not used: no module_param dump trigger was added. The debugfs file above is the single documented mechanism; the module_param path would require a writable parameter whose only effect is a log dump, which is harder to consume and cannot be captured atomically before/after a modeset.

## 6. Exact command to close the gap once root is available
